Package: examsstudio
Title: Visual Authoring Studio for R/exams Exercises
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Wolfgang", "Hößl",
                    email = "wolfgang.hoessl@oth-regensburg.de",
                    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny dashboard for composing dynamic R/exams exercises
    (num, schoice, mchoice, cloze) with variable grids, plausibility
    checks, EU/US number formatting, and Moodle/PDF export. Uses the
    modern add_cloze() / format_metainfo() syntax.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    exams (>= 2.4.0),
    shiny (>= 1.8.0),
    bslib (>= 0.6.0),
    plotly,
    DT,
    yaml,
    jsonlite,
    htmltools,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    exams2forms,
    tinytex,
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
